{"2548410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "In the Same Boat", "steam_appid": 2548410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail on an unforgettable journey across the vast expanse of the seven seas! In this captivating <strong>cooperative sailing game</strong>, one player commands the ship, while the other is confined to the captain's cabin, solely navigating with the map. Successfully completing their missions on time will demand the crew's adept <strong>communication</strong>, <strong>skill</strong>, and <strong>composure</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/01864b2927b7a3ad4eafa532ac22c256.avif?t=1787394957\" width=1350 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/a2461538a04dc142a917f180f4ad1acc.poster.avif?t=1787394957\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/a2461538a04dc142a917f180f4ad1acc.webm?t=1787394957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/a2461538a04dc142a917f180f4ad1acc.mp4?t=1787394957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>unique and fun gameplay dynamic</strong> where one player takes the helm as the <strong>Sailor</strong>, while the other assumes the role of the  <strong>Cartographer, </strong>guiding their partner through treacherous waters. Success in this maritime quest hinges on <strong>excellent communication and cooperation between</strong> both players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/c05bccbc837d376a71c63c21d92251c2.avif?t=1787394957\" width=1350 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/76c2eb88d909f4f2ad3b74e0d1829110.poster.avif?t=1787394957\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/76c2eb88d909f4f2ad3b74e0d1829110.webm?t=1787394957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/76c2eb88d909f4f2ad3b74e0d1829110.mp4?t=1787394957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the unknown waters with each game (around 15 minutes), as a new procedurally generated world unfurls before your eyes. Immerse yourself in <strong>several unique biomes</strong>, each with its own wonders and challenges. As the Cartographer, you'll face the daunting task of <strong>completing the map manually</strong>, strategically placing landmarks and ports to chart a course for the Sailor towards your desired destinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/474bca61594597db4b07bad4224d2b1c.avif?t=1787394957\" width=1350 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/091acbdef0d127b3565608417541a1c3.poster.avif?t=1787394957\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/091acbdef0d127b3565608417541a1c3.webm?t=1787394957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/091acbdef0d127b3565608417541a1c3.mp4?t=1787394957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple unique <strong>missions</strong>: cargo delivery, pirate hunting, archeology, treasure hunting... Each one with its own set of challenges and <strong>mini-games</strong>. Beware, though, for the treacherous seas are home to cunning <strong>pirates</strong> and <strong>sea monsters</strong> eager to test your mettle. Play with wit and <strong>strategy</strong>, attempting to steer clear of danger, or <strong>embrace bravery</strong> and rush in, relying on your cannons to overcome the perils that lie ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail on an unforgettable journey across the vast expanse of the seven seas! In this captivating <strong>cooperative sailing game</strong>, one player commands the ship, while the other is confined to the captain's cabin, solely navigating with the map. Successfully completing their missions on time will demand the crew's adept <strong>communication</strong>, <strong>skill</strong>, and <strong>composure</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/01864b2927b7a3ad4eafa532ac22c256.avif?t=1787394957\" width=1350 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/a2461538a04dc142a917f180f4ad1acc.poster.avif?t=1787394957\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/a2461538a04dc142a917f180f4ad1acc.webm?t=1787394957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/a2461538a04dc142a917f180f4ad1acc.mp4?t=1787394957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a <strong>unique and fun gameplay dynamic</strong> where one player takes the helm as the <strong>Sailor</strong>, while the other assumes the role of the  <strong>Cartographer, </strong>guiding their partner through treacherous waters. Success in this maritime quest hinges on <strong>excellent communication and cooperation between</strong> both players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/c05bccbc837d376a71c63c21d92251c2.avif?t=1787394957\" width=1350 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/76c2eb88d909f4f2ad3b74e0d1829110.poster.avif?t=1787394957\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/76c2eb88d909f4f2ad3b74e0d1829110.webm?t=1787394957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/76c2eb88d909f4f2ad3b74e0d1829110.mp4?t=1787394957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the unknown waters with each game (around 15 minutes), as a new procedurally generated world unfurls before your eyes. Immerse yourself in <strong>several unique biomes</strong>, each with its own wonders and challenges. As the Cartographer, you'll face the daunting task of <strong>completing the map manually</strong>, strategically placing landmarks and ports to chart a course for the Sailor towards your desired destinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/474bca61594597db4b07bad4224d2b1c.avif?t=1787394957\" width=1350 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/091acbdef0d127b3565608417541a1c3.poster.avif?t=1787394957\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/091acbdef0d127b3565608417541a1c3.webm?t=1787394957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548410/extras/091acbdef0d127b3565608417541a1c3.mp4?t=1787394957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple unique <strong>missions</strong>: cargo delivery, pirate hunting, archeology, treasure hunting... Each one with its own set of challenges and <strong>mini-games</strong>. Beware, though, for the treacherous seas are home to cunning <strong>pirates</strong> and <strong>sea monsters</strong> eager to test your mettle. Play with wit and <strong>strategy</strong>, attempting to steer clear of danger, or <strong>embrace bravery</strong> and rush in, relying on your cannons to overcome the perils that lie ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Embark on an adventure across the ocean! In this captivating cooperative sailing game, one player commands the ship, while the other is confined to the captain's cabin, solely navigating with the map. Successfully completing your missions will require the crew's adept communication and skill.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header